(generic-point-mass-contract)
*title Generic point-mass contract and bridge fixture
*mode point-mass
*atmos none
*earth spherical gm=0 omega=0
*units/fmt alt m f.3
*units/fmt vel m/sec f.3
*units/fmt mass kg f.3

*trajectory 1 generic-vehicle start on 1
  *initial ecic x=7000000.0 y=0.0 z=0.0 xdt=0.0 ydt=100.0 zdt=0.0 time=0.0 mass=1.0
  *segment 1 inertial-coast
    *integ dtprnt=0.1 dt=0.1
    *when time>10.0 stop
*end
